  "description": "A composable functional framework for encoding quantum operators\n      on Fock space as qubit Pauli operators. Implements Jordan-Wigner,\n      Bravyi-Kitaev, Parity, and tree-based encodings (balanced binary,\n      balanced ternary) for fermionic systems, plus unary, binary, and\n      Gray-code truncation encodings for bosonic systems. Supports\n      bosonic normal-ordering algebra and mixed fermion-boson workflows.",
  "id": "FockMap",
